f=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/20-50.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Taa-Haa 20:50 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"&quot;Bizim Rabbimiz, her şeye yaratılışını veren ve sonra da doğru yolu gösterendir.&quot; dedi.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre Taa-Haa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/20.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 50\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/20-50.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/20.html\">Sûre Taa-Haa</a> › Âyet 50</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Taa-Haa 20:50</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قَالَ رَبُّنَا الَّذِي أَعْطَىٰ كُلَّ شَيْءٍ خَلْقَهُ ثُمَّ هَدَىٰ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">&quot;Bizim Rabbimiz, her şeye yaratılışını veren ve sonra da doğru yolu gösterendir.&quot; dedi.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالخلق يتناول كل ما سواه من المخلوقات<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/111</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أي أعطى كل شيء صورته التي لا يشتبه فيها بغيره<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 2/35</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والمعنى أعطاه من الخلق والتصوير ما يصلح به لما خلق له ثم هداه لما خلق له وهداه لما يصلحه في معيشته ومطعمه ومشربه ومنكحه وتقلبه وتصرفه هذا هو القول الصحيح الذي عليه جمهور المفسرين<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وكذلك كل عضو له هداية تليق به فهدى الرجلين للمشي واليدين للبطش والعمل واللسان للكلام والأذن للاستماع والعين لكشف المرئيات وكل عضو لما خلق له<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 2/35</cite></blockquote><h3>Başkalarından naklettikleri</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">مجاهد</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «أعطى كل شيء خلقه لم يعط الإنسان خلق البهائم ولا البهائم خلق الإنسان»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">عطية ومقاتل</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «قال عطية ومقاتل: &quot;أعطى كل شيء صورته&quot;»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الحسن وقتادة</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «وقال الحسن وقتادة: &quot;أعطى كل شيء صلاحه&quot;»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الكلبي والسدي وابن قتيبة والفراء</span> <span class=\"st\">ردّه</span> «وقال الكلبي والسدي: &quot;أعطى الرجل المرأة والبعير الناقة والذكر الأنثى من جنسه&quot; ولفظ السدي: &quot;أعطى الذكر الأنثى مثل خلقه ثم هدى إلى الجماع&quot; وهذا القول اختيار ابن قتيبة والفراء»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الفراء</span> <span class=\"st\">ردّه</span> «قال الفراء: &quot;أعطى الذكر من الناس امرأة مثله والشاة شاة والثور بقرة ثم ألهم الذكر كيف يأتيها&quot;»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">أبو إسحاق</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «قال أبو إسحاق: &quot;وهذا التفسير جائز لأنا نرى الذكر من الحيوان يأتي الأنثى ولم ير ذكرا قد أتى أنثى قبله فألهمه الله ذلك وهداه إليه&quot; قال: والقول الأول ينتظم هذا المعنى لأنه إذا هداه لمصلحته فهذا داخل في المصلحة»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/78</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s20a50\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/20-48.html\">Önceki âyet (20:48)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/20-52.html\">Sonraki âyet (20:52)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/20-52.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Taa-Haa 20:52 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"&quot;Onlarla ilgili bilgi Rabbimin katında bir kitaptadır.&quot; dedi. &quot;Rabbim, şaşırmaz ve unutmaz.&quot;\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/20-52.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Taa-Haa 20:52 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"&quot;Onlarla ilgili bilgi Rabbimin katında bir kitaptadır.&quot; dedi. &quot;Rabbim, şaşırmaz ve unutmaz.&quot;\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre Taa-Haa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/20.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 52\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/20-52.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/20.html\">Sûre Taa-Haa</a> › Âyet 52</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Taa-Haa 20:52</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قَالَ عِلْمُهَا عِندَ رَبِّي فِي كِتَابٍ لَّا يَضِلُّ رَبِّي وَلَا يَنسَى﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">&quot;Onlarla ilgili bilgi Rabbimin katında bir kitaptadır.&quot; dedi. &quot;Rabbim, şaşırmaz ve unutmaz.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">النسيان والخطأ، كما قال تعالى: {لا يضل ربي ولا ينسى} [طه: 52]<cite>«درء تعارض العقل والنقل» 10/246</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s20a52\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/20-50.html\">Önceki âyet (20:50)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/20-55.html\">Sonraki âyet (20:55)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/20-55.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Taa-Haa 20:55 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sizi topraktan yarattık, sizi oraya döndüreceğiz ve sizi bir kere daha oradan çıkaracağız.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/20-55.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Taa-Haa 20:55 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sizi topraktan yarattık, sizi oraya döndüreceğiz ve sizi bir kere daha oradan çıkaracağız.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre Taa-Haa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/20.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 55\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/20-55.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/20.html\">Sûre Taa-Haa</a> › Âyet 55</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Taa-Haa 20:55</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿مِنْهَا خَلَقْنَاكُمْ وَفِيهَا نُعِيدُكُمْ وَمِنْهَا نُخْرِجُكُمْ تَارَةً أُخْرَىٰ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sizi topraktan yarattık, sizi oraya döndüreceğiz ve sizi bir kere daha oradan çıkaracağız.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">من التراب وإلى التراب يعودون. كما قال تعالى: {منها خلقناكم وفيها نعيدكم ومنها نخرجكم تارة أخرى}<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 17/250</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s20a55\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/20-52.html\">Önceki âyet (20:52)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/20-71.html\">Sonraki âyet (20:71)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/20-71.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Taa-Haa 20:71 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"(Firavun) dedi ki: &qu